        "sectionTitle": "About Us",
        "title": "Compassion in Action, Community at Heart",
        "description": "Since 2018, Nabarun has supported children, orphans, senior citizens, and vulnerable families across North Kolkata and North Suburban Kolkata — through education, relief, and care that reaches people when they need it most.",
